# G.I. Joe TEST RANGE (BUILD-2, John 17 Nov 2026 19:33): a New Battle mission to look at and try everything.
# Pick "TEST RANGE" as the mission in New Battle, any craft. Your side: every named Joe, every Joe vehicle, every piece of
# kit piled where you start (engine: Battlescape/Testbed.cpp loads them whatever the craft holds). The other side: one of
# every Cobra unit below, standing still - no grenades, no spare clips, every gun emptied, no TU, AI off.
# The map is the stock farm terrain for now. MAPS made TESTRANGE for it (claude/NOTE_FOR_BUILD_TestRange.txt); the map
# files are private, so BUILD-1 swaps it in: terrains: [TESTRANGE] (and its map script) in place of CULTA below.
# To add a new Cobra unit: one more entry in data.
mapScripts:
  - type: STR_GJ_TESTBED_SCRIPT
    commands:
    - type: fillArea
alienDeployments:
  - type: STR_GJ_TESTBED
    width: 60
    length: 60
    height: 4
    terrains: [CULTA]
    script: STR_GJ_TESTBED_SCRIPT
    race: STR_COBRA
    shade: 0
    data:
      - alienRank: 0
        customUnitType: STR_COBRA_COMMANDER_UNIT
